  <diagram id="risc-v-instruction-path-f02-o3-request-pipeline" name="Target Scale6 path through an out-of-order core" ecgTitle="Target Scale6 path through an out-of-order core" ecgDescription="An explicit register dependency connects the Scale6 record load to the property access. Standard fetch, decode, rename, issue, AGU, LSQ, translation and cache structures retain ordinary execution semantics. A separate retirement-only update route must carry committed predictions to the LLC, including for private hits. Squashed operations cannot enqueue refreshes.">
